    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 11,
      "snippet": "After about 240ms, measurement result is registered to Data Register."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 2,
      "snippet": "H-Resolution Mode Measurement Time               t HR     ...   Typ.    120    180        ms"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 2,
      "snippet": "L-Resolution Mode Measurement Time               t LR     ...   Typ.     16     24        ms"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 4,
      "snippet": "Data Register → This is for registration of Ambient Light Data. Initial Value is \"0000_0000_0000_0000\"."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 4,
      "snippet": "Measurement Time Register → This is for registration of measurement time. Initial Value is \"0100_0101\"."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 11,
      "snippet": "H-reslution mode : Illuminance per 1 count ( lx / count )    = 1 / 1.2 *( 69 / X )"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 11,
      "snippet": "H-reslution mode2 : Illuminance per 1 count ( lx / count )    = 1 / 1.2 *( 69 / X ) / 2"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 6,
      "snippet": "DVI is I 2 C bus reference voltage terminal. And it is also asynchronous reset terminal. It is necessary to set to 'L' after VCC is supplied."
    }
  ],
